  "title": "Basic Beef Brisket in a Dutch Oven",
  "description": "This simple Dutch oven brisket recipe results in an incredibly delicious, tender brisket after just a few hours of simmering in a savory, seasoned broth.",
  "authors": [
    "ChefTony"
  ],
